---
config:
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: false
    actorMargin: 30
    messageMargin: 25
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Producer
    participant API as Ingestion API
    participant DB as Store
    participant Workers as Workers
    actor UI as Dashboard

    Producer->>API: Submit flow batch
    API->>API: Validate complete request
    alt request rejected
        API-->>Producer: 4xx response, nothing enqueued
    else request accepted
        API->>DB: Enqueue new event IDs atomically
        DB-->>API: Accepted and duplicate dispositions
        API-->>Producer: 202 Accepted
    end

    loop each eligible job
        Workers->>DB: Claim job with processing lease
        DB-->>Workers: Canonical observation
        Workers->>Workers: Run verified model cascade
        alt processing succeeds
            Workers->>DB: Commit result, transition,<br/>and outbox events atomically
        else processing fails
            Workers->>DB: Commit retry or dead-letter state
        end
    end

    opt committed outbox event available
        Workers->>DB: Claim unpublished event
        DB-->>Workers: Event payload
        Workers-)UI: WebSocket prediction or alert
        Workers->>DB: Mark published or schedule retry
    end

    note over Workers: This subsystem contains separate ingestion-worker<br/>and outbox-publisher executions.
